// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// Element spec:
// pinhole        → SphereGeometry(0.07) black at origin
// camera axes    → ArrowHelpers: Xc +X len 1.6, Yc +Y len 2.2, Zc +Z len 5.2, black
// P              → SphereGeometry(0.09) #33aaff, draggable
