// virtual plane  → PlaneGeometry 3.2×3.2 at z=+f, #c8d0d0 opacity .25 + border
// proj dot       → SphereGeometry(0.06) #33aaff on virtual plane
// plane axes     → green #22cc22 arrows x,y AT THE PROJECTION DOT + right-angle marker
// sensor         → LineSegments grid N×M at z=-f, gray; principal-point dot black
// sensor image   → INVERTED projection of object panel (green square, yellow subs, red band)
